{"include_website_name method is missing the required '?' convention used elsewhere for conditional include hooks, so it won't properly act as a conditional include": 0.5207021832466125, "website_name is serialized without the TL0-anonymous 'untrusted attributes' restriction, so anonymous users may see a TL0 user's website text even when website is intentionally hidden": 0.898330569267273, "The template renders website link based on model.website_name while the href uses model.website, which can produce a broken/empty link if website is hidden but website_name is exposed": 0.38631951808929443}